      "description": "Designs, develops new, and maintains existing application features. Manages the DevOps to ensure smooth product development and delivery. Responsible for troubleshooting critical application failures on deployed systems.\n\nENGINEERING PERFORMANCE & INNOVATION\n•\tResponsible for the development of tools for search, content analysis, call graph visualization, and program control flow analysis.\n•\tCreated an automated system for generating and deploying update packages for the application – reducing software package generation and deployment time.\n•\tImproved software development and delivery processes using modern CI/CD techniques and tools.\n•\tDesigned and developed an installer that deploys the application with minimal human intervention providing deployment efficiency and improved customer satisfaction. \n•\tManages the DevOps operations on a daily basis using Atlassian Bamboo, BitBucket, and other tools.\n•\tProvided solution to reduce open-source security vulnerabilities by integrating OWASP in our CI/CD pipelines.\n•\tDesign and develop new application features based on business requirements.\n•\tDesigned a chat-based assistant in the application resulting in an increased user engagement. The Assistant enabled users to accomplish their tasks with fewer clicks and cognitive taxation.\n•\tImplemented rigorous product testing and analysis to evaluate product performance, resulting in reduction in bugs and application crashes. \n•\tPartnered with the University of Texas at Dallas to mentor and lead a group of senior students in the development of a mobile application for managing and tracking tasks for pets. \n\nBUSINESS PERFORMANCE \n•\tLiaison with Fortune 100 clients in technical troubleshooting and support of deployed application.\n•\tActed as the product lead by providing product integration and upgrades for clients and offered solutions to customer issues. \n•\tProvided technical training for clients during our annual Administrator Training Conference.",
